# Planning With Beads

Planning belongs to `umo-agentic-core`.

Use beads as the default planning substrate when the repo provides `bd`.
Planning records must include:

- clear acceptance criteria;
- dependencies and blockers;
- owner or reviewer when known;
- evidence required for closeout;
- link to proposal, ADR, spec, or issue when applicable.

Do not create a separate planning plugin in v1. Functional plugins, including
audit plugins, must use the core Planning phase to create remediation beads or
plans after their functional report exists.
